      "notes": "Rig v2 (W2 joint contract): wings, antennae, funiculi and halteres are presentation joints (animated, not simulated); legs, body and floor contact unchanged from v1. Clips are illustrative animation, not simulated behaviour: no aerodynamics, mechanosensation, grooming decision or connectome output is implied, and clips are never overlaid on recorded or live telemetry. W3's stated limits: thorax (notum) grooming is omitted, because the rig's planar legs cannot reach it without piercing the body; wing pitch is limited to [-0.07, 0.13] rad, so the large wing rotation at stroke reversal is NOT shown; wingbeat is slowed about 175x (1.25 Hz shown vs 218 Hz cited); antenna motion and funiculus rotation are exaggerated; grooming paths, timing and stroke counts are invented for display. walk_tripod_loop walks in place (no root motion) and takeoff_prep only prepares: no flight is shown. No proboscis clip (the rig has no proboscis joint). Appearance only.",
